sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant L as Lecturer
    participant GRD as Grading API
    participant GDB as assignment_grading schema
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    participant NOT as Notification consumer
    participant NDB as notification schema
    L->>GRD: PUT /submissions/{id}/grade
    GRD->>GDB: BEGIN
    GRD->>GDB: check marks ≤ max · INSERT/UPDATE grades
    GRD->>GDB: UPDATE submissions SET status = GRADED
    GRD->>GDB: COMMIT
    GRD-)MQ: grading.grade-posted (after commit)
    MQ-)NOT: deliver (at least once)
    NOT->>NDB: BEGIN
    NOT->>NDB: already have source_event_id for this user? → skip (idempotent)
    NOT->>NDB: read notification_preferences
    NOT->>NDB: INSERT notifications
    NOT->>NDB: COMMIT
    NOT-)NOT: after commit: live push (SSE) + email
